{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:04 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:04 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:04 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66eef78c935a14fca5dd1107febaf1a8/2026-11/2026-11-27_17_42_32.png\"/><p>屯門康景花園發生墮樓事件。周五（27日）下午約4時25分，警方接獲青善街58號康景花園保安報案，指一名男子倒臥大廈對開，懷疑從高處墮下。救援人員到場檢查，證實男子已明顯死亡。</p><p>警方經初步調查，確認死者為屋苑一名61歲姓李男住戶，相信他從單位墮下。現場沒有檢獲遺書，案件列作「屍體發現」，死因有待驗屍確定。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:24:21.374397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:04:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:57:48.978697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:49.531647+00:00","content_hash":"128b9f596f5cda06522c717b063e4a4b9b676a94931d791f066729c863f0dad9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}